{"title":"🎃🍂 PUMPKINS AFTER DARK – MARKHAM ROAD TRIP! 🍂🎃","startsAt":"2026-10-17T20:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-18T22:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"🎃🍂 PUMPKINS AFTER DARK – MARKHAM ROAD TRIP! 🍂🎃\nSaturday, October 17\n\nLooking for the perfect pre-Halloween/Fall activity? One of our group members, Emma, suggested this cool idea — so we're heading out to Pumpkins After Dark in Markham! 🎃✨\n\nThis will be the FIRST TIME our Meetup group has done Pumpkins After Dark, and it looks like a fantastic way to get into the Halloween spirit!\n\n🌙 THE PLAN\n\nWe'll meet at 8:00 PM outside Christie Station and then head to Markham together in a rental SUV.\n\nThe road trip transportation includes:\n\n🚙 Round-trip transportation from Toronto\n🎃 Transportation to and from Pumpkins After Dark\n👻 A fun evening with the group\n🍂 A perfect Fall/pre-Halloween night out!\n\n💰 TRANSPORTATION: $25\n\nThe $25 covers your round-trip transportation only.\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANT: Your Pumpkins After Dark admission ticket is NOT included. You must purchase your own event admission separately.\n\n🎟️ Buy your Pumpkins After Dark ticket here:\n\nhttps://pumpkinsafterdark.com/markham\n\n🚨 RESERVE YOUR SPOT\n\nBecause we're using a rental SUV with limited space, your spot is NOT locked in until I receive your $25 e-transfer.\n\n📧 E-transfer: nicolasbello@yahoo.com\n💵 $25 per person\n\nPlease don't RSVP unless you're committed to coming and can send the $25 to secure your spot.\n\n🎃 WHY THIS WILL BE FUN\n\nThink giant glowing pumpkins, Halloween displays, crisp Fall weather, music, photos and a bunch of friends enjoying one of the most seasonal activities around.\n\nIt's basically the perfect excuse to start celebrating Halloween before Halloween actually arrives! 👻🍂\n\nCome for the pumpkins, stay for the road-trip fun!\n\nFirst time for our group — let's make it a good one! 🎃🚙","venue":{"name":"Christie Station","address":"Bloor and Christie, Toronto","lat":43.66356,"lng":-79.41841,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/0/e/4/highres_536333476.jpeg"}